  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Information Centre &#x201c;I choose Lithuania&#x201d; 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at facilitating the return and reintegration of nationals of the Republic of Lithuania, their family members as well as foreigners arriving in Lithuania through information and counseling provided by the IOM Migration Information Centre. It responds to the current migration context in Lithuania, where emigration rates are still among the highest in Europe, but a significant number of Lithuanians envisage returning home. Numbers of foreign nationals coming to live in Lithuania are also steadily increasing. Successful completion of migration information centre activities and projects in the previous years of operation proves that there is a great and increasing need to provide relevant and consistent information on return and reintegration into Lithuanian society for migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
